  <!-- STATEMENT -->
  <section class="statement wrap reveal">
    <p class="lede">Your skin keeps a record of <span class="accent">everything.</span></p>
    <p>Sun, sleep, water, the products you swore you'd stop using. The good news is that it's never too late to change the story. That's the work here: reading where your skin is headed, and pointing it somewhere better.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section class="about" id="about">
    <div class="wrap about-grid">
      <div class="portrait reveal" role="img" aria-label="Carrie Wright, esthetician at Spa Wasted"></div>
      <div class="about-copy reveal">
        <p class="role">Carrie Wright, LE</p>
        <h2>Read your skin's future.</h2>
        <p>The skin is so under-looked at the right time and over-looked at the wrong time.</p>
        <p>The best time to start caring about your face is at puberty. Everything you do (or don't do) to your face makes a difference in the future. Sun exposure, hydration, skin products, moisturizers, pimples, and acne are all part of the platform we lay for our skin's future. What if you could prolong aging, prevent skin cancer, prevent scarring, and crow's feet?</p>
        <p>Come see Carrie Wright and learn how to read your skin's future! Carrie Wright is a successful Esthetician in Los Alamitos and specializes in Diamond Tip Microdermabrasion facials.</p>
        <p>At Spa Wasted, Carrie's facials make people walk away with the feeling of Bliss and glowing skin, plus a touch of being Spawasted.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICES -->
  <section class="services" id="services">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="svc-head reveal">
        <h2>The Menu</h2>
        <p class="eyebrow">Facials &amp; skin treatments</p>
      </div>

      <div class="svc-group reveal">
        <p class="glabel">Facials</p>
        <div class="svc">
          <button class="svc-toggle" aria-expanded="false"><span class="svc-name">Anti-Aging Facial<span class="svc-sub">&ldquo;Turn Back Time&rdquo;</span></span><span class="svc-meta"><span class="svc-price">$135</span><span class="svc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button>
          <div class="svc-panel"><div class="svc-panel-inner"><p>A must-have in your beauty regimen. This anti-aging facial focuses on reducing fine lines and wrinkles, evens out skin texture and tone, and leaves your skin soft, smooth, supple, and radiant. A powerful multivitamin exfoliant rejuvenates while infusing antioxidants that fight free-radical damage, leaving skin bright and hydrated. Finished with an antioxidant mask, then hyaluronic acid that binds to water for greater hydration, and an SPF specific to your skin type.</p>
            <p class="svc-pricing">50 min &middot; $135 &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp; 3-pack &middot; $385</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="svc">
          <button class="svc-toggle" aria-expanded="false"><span class="svc-name">Vitamin C Recovery Facial<span class="svc-sub">&ldquo;Too Much Fun, Too Much Sun&rdquo;</span></span><span class="svc-meta"><span class="svc-price">$135</span><span class="svc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button>
          <div class="svc-panel"><div class="svc-panel-inner"><p>Think of vitamin C as a super food for your skin. Because it's water soluble, you can't eat enough to benefit your skin, you eliminate it faster than your skin can absorb it. Applied topically, though, it works wonders. This relaxing facial restores skin from free-radical damage, sun exposure, and hyperpigmentation, aids the collagen production that plumps skin, and helps with age spots. It leaves skin glowing and bright, and finishes with a rich vitamin-C mask and an SPF for your skin type.</p>
            <p class="svc-pricing">50 min &middot; $135 &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp; 3-pack &middot; $385</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="svc">
          <button class="svc-toggle" aria-expanded="false"><span class="svc-name">Clarifying Acne Facial<span class="svc-sub">&ldquo;I Am Over You, Acne!&rdquo;</span></span><span class="svc-meta"><span class="svc-price">$135</span><span class="svc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button>
          <div class="svc-panel"><div class="svc-panel-inner"><p>A few things to know about acne: it's challenging to treat because there are so many contributors, bacteria, sebum production, lifestyle, homecare, and genetics. I'm passionate about treating acne and have had real success because I don't take a cookie-cutter approach. I customize this facial to your grade of acne, your sensitivity, your dryness, your oil production, and your blackheads. That matters to me, and I can't wait to help you.</p>
            <p class="svc-pricing">50 min &middot; $135 &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp; 3-pack &middot; $385</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="svc">
          <button class="svc-toggle" aria-expanded="false"><span class="svc-name">Diamond Tip Microdermabrasion Facial<span class="svc-sub">&ldquo;Red Carpet Special&rdquo;</span></span><span class="svc-meta"><span class="svc-price">$200</span><span class="svc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button>
          <div class="svc-panel"><div class="svc-panel-inner"><p>Diamond Tip Microdermabrasion paired with LED light therapy, this combination is a powerhouse. The microdermabrasion reduces fine lines and wrinkles, removes the top layer of dead skin, clears blackheads, improves acne scars, minimizes pores, and reduces sun damage while boosting collagen for firmer, toned skin. Red LED targets anti-aging, fine lines, wrinkles, and age spots while building collagen, and blue LED destroys the bacteria behind breakouts. Works best in a series of 4 or more. Finished with a cool colloidal mask worked in with a cooling wand that feels fabulous, then a barrier-repair intensive, a recovery hydrator, and an SPF for your skin type.</p>
            <p class="svc-pricing">50 min &middot; $200 &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp; 3-pack &middot; $400</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

