        </div>
        <div class="rev-card">
          <span class="rev-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span>
          <p class="rev-quote">I just had my first ever facial and Carrie made it an incredible experience! She explained every step in the process, really helped me understand my skin, gave me recommendations for in between appointments, and created such a personalized experience. Her space is beautiful and so relaxing - I was very at peace. Carrie herself has such a kind and comfortable energy. I have already booked my next few facials and so look forward to watching my skin continue to transform under her care.</p>
